OL,3,ABBC director general defends plan to
OL,4,Ashelve new Archers studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC's director general says he is
OL,7,Fexploring options to keep the recording
OL,8,Fof The Archers in the West Midlands,
OL,9,Fbut added there was other studio space
OL,10,Faround the country that could be used.
OL,12,FPlans to build a bespoke studio for the
OL,13,Flong-running Radio 4 soap at the BBC's
OL,14,Fnew flagship Tea Factory building in
OL,15,FDigbeth, Birmingham, were shelved this
OL,16,Fweek as part of a wider drive to cut
OL,17,Fcosts.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
